    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Easily create stylish and fully customizable accordions for your WordPress site. Perfect for FAQs, toggle sections, or content organization. Supports responsive design, smoothly, and dynamic content. No coding required—just add, and customize!</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com/demo/accordion\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demos</a></strong></p>\n<h3>Why this version works better:</h3>\n<p>-Engagement: Starts with a clear &#8220;benefit&#8221; statement from your second draft.</p>\n<p>-Detail: Retains the specific names of the Pro themes you wanted to highlight.</p>\n<p>-Clarity: Clearly mentions &#8220;No-code&#8221; and &#8220;Gutenberg-ready,&#8221; which are huge selling points for WordPress users.</p>\n<p>-Flow: It moves logically from &#8220;what it is&#8221; to &#8220;specific features&#8221; and ends with a &#8220;call to action.&#8221;</p>\n<h3>⭐ Key Features – Free Version</h3>\n<p>The free version provides essential tools to create professional and responsive accordions for any WordPress site.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Fully Responsive Design:</strong>  Automatically adjusts to fit perfectly on Desktops, Tablets, and Mobile screens.</p>\n<p>– <strong>3 Elegant Free Themes:</strong>  Access to the first three clean and minimalist design templates.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Multiple Style Variations:</strong>  Includes pre-designed accordion styles to get started quickly.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Gutenberg Block Support:</strong>  Easy-to-use dedicated block for the WordPress block editor (no coding required).</p>\n<p>– <strong>Vertical &amp; Horizontal Layouts:</strong> Flexibility to display your accordion content either vertically or horizontally.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Dynamic Content Support:</strong>  Insert text, images, links accordion items.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Unlimited Accordions:</strong> Create and publish as many accordions as you need on your website.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Smooth Transition Effects:</strong> High-quality animations for opening and closing accordion tabs.</p>\n<p>– <strong>No Coding Required:</strong> User-friendly interface makes it easy to build and style accordions without technical skills.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Lightweight &amp; Fast:</strong> Minimal load time and optimized queries.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Icon Support for Toggles:</strong> Choose from various toggle icons or upload custom icons for expand and collapse actions.</p>\n<h3>🔥 Pro Version – Unlock Premium Power</h3>\n<p>The Pro version unlocks advanced design capabilities and premium customization for     power users.</p>\n<p><strong>What’s Included in Pro:</strong></p>\n<p>– <strong>5+ Premium Themes:</strong>  Unlocks the last 5 exclusive themes shown in the screenshots, featuring modern and creative layouts.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Progress Timeline Theme:</strong> Visual roadmap for project steps with sequential lines and active status indicators.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Geometric Bold Theme:</strong> Modern design featuring sharp angles, bold borders, and high-impact dynamic hover effects.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Vertical &amp; History Timeline Themes:</strong> Chronological layout perfect for displaying company milestones and historical events with dates.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Tabbed Accordion Theme:</strong> Smart hybrid layout combining tabs and accordions to organize dense content efficiently.</p>\n<p>– **Priority Technical Support: **  Direct access to the developer team for quick troubleshooting and updates</p>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the B Accordion plugin</li>\n<li>Add the Accordion block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Do you have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:&#115;u&#x70;&#112;&#x6f;&#114;&#x74;&#064;&#x62;&#112;l&#x75;&#103;&#x69;&#110;&#x73;&#046;&#x63;&#x6f;&#109;\" title=\"Send feedback\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Please share your feedback with us</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>⭐ Check out the Parent Plugin of this plugin-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bblockswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">B Blocks</a></strong> – Best gutenberg blocks collections for WordPress.</p>\n<h3>⭐ Check out our other WordPress Plugins-</h3>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-audio-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Audio Player</a></strong> – Best audio player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/html5-video-player\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Html5 Video Player</a></strong> – Best video player plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/pdf-poster\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">PDF Poster</a></strong> – A fully-featured PDF Viewer Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/document-embedder\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Document Embedder</a></strong> – Best WordPress Document Embedder Plugin.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/3d-viewer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">3D Viewer</a></strong> – Display interactive 3D models on the webs.</p>\n<p>🔥 <strong><a href=\"https://bplugins.com/products/advanced-post-block\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Advanced Post Block</a></strong> – Best Post Display Plugin for WordPress.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<h4>From Gutenberg Editor:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Go to the WordPress Block/Gutenberg Editor</li>\n<li>Search For <strong>B Accordion</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Accordion</strong> to add the block</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Download &amp; Upload:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the <strong>B Accordion</strong> plugin (<em>.zip file</em>)</li>\n<li>In your admin area, go to the Plugins menu and click on <strong>Add New</strong></li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> and choose the <strong><code>b-accordion.zip</code></strong> file and click on <strong>Install Now</strong></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin and Enjoy!</li>\n</ol>\n<h4>Manually:</h4>\n<ol>\n<li>Download and upload the <strong>B Accordion</strong> plugin to the <strong><code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></strong> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the Plugins menu in WordPress</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='is%20b%20accordion%20block%20free%3F'>\nIs B Accordion Block free?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, B Accordion Block is a free Gutenberg block plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='does%20it%20work%20with%20any%20wordpress%20theme%3F'>\nDoes it work with any WordPress theme?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, it will work with any standard WordPress theme.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20change%20block%20settings%3F'>\nCan I change block settings?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, you can change block settings from the Gutenberg block editor&#8217;s right sidebar.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20many%20times%20can%20i%20reuse%20a%20block%3F'>\nHow many times can I reuse a block?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can use unlimited times as you want.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20support%3F'>\nWhere can I get support?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>You can post your questions on the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/b-accordion/\" rel=\"ugc\">support forum here</a></p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.0 &#8211; 2025-12-24</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Updated with new a lot features and major updates of the plugin</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8 &#8211; 15 Jan, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Same page use multiple accordion</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7 &#8211; 12 Jan, 2025</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Title problem issue fixed</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6 &#8211; 19 Dec, 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Create shortcode for accordion</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6 &#8211; 19 Dec, 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Create shortcode for accordion</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5 &#8211; 15 Nov, 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix horizontal content not display.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4 &#8211; 14 Nov, 2024</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>I have added some new features.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Reduce assets loads</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Support for HTML content</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Add translate feature</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial Release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Make a fully functional accordion to display various contents professionally.",
