closing accordion tabs.</p>\n<p>– <strong>No Coding Required:</strong> User-friendly interface makes it easy to build and style accordions without technical skills.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Lightweight &amp; Fast:</strong> Minimal load time and optimized queries.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Icon Support for Toggles:</strong> Choose from various toggle icons or upload custom icons for expand and collapse actions.</p>\n<h3>🔥 Pro Version – Unlock Premium Power</h3>\n<p>The Pro version unlocks advanced design capabilities and premium customization for     power users.</p>\n<p><strong>What’s Included in Pro:</strong></p>\n<p>– <strong>5+ Premium Themes:</strong>  Unlocks the last 5 exclusive themes shown in the screenshots, featuring modern and creative layouts.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Progress Timeline Theme:</strong> Visual roadmap for project steps with sequential lines and active status indicators.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Geometric Bold Theme:</strong> Modern design featuring sharp angles, bold borders, and high-impact dynamic hover effects.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Vertical &amp; History Timeline Themes:</strong> Chronological layout perfect for displaying company milestones and historical events with dates.</p>\n<p>– <strong>Tabbed Accordion Theme:</strong> Smart hybrid layout combining tabs and accordions to organize dense content efficiently.</p>\n<p>– **Priority Technical Support: **  Direct access to the developer team for quick troubleshooting and updates</p>\n<h4>How to use</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>First, install the B Accordion plugin</li>\n<li>Add the Accordion block from the block category called &#8220;Widgets&#8221; in the Gutenberg editor.</li>\n<li>You can change block settings from the right-side settings sidebar.</li>\n<li>\n<p>Enjoy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>For installation help click on Installation Tab.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Feedback</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Did you like this plugin? Dislike it? Do you have a feature request? <a href=\"mailto:&#115;u&#x70;&#112;&#x6f;&#114;&#x74;&#064;&#x62;&#112;l&#x7